  "details": "Just a script that accepts system time for VRChat\n\nIt would be used to display in game time and actual alarms to keep worlds lively or shifting depending on time of day\n\nIt is designed to just accept the time have have a notepad where it \"lazy\"checks f\nHe sysclock and activates world triggers\nSuch as the Great Pug playing a \"live\" band every two hours \nOr a in map clock where when it's midnight, it activates a secret door or tells the player to go to bed\n\nIt doesn't have to object sync like everything else in the world but it is great just to have it soon rather than wait for udon's finalization",
